  <releases>
    <release version="0.1.0" date="2026-09-27" urgency="medium">
      <description>
        <p>First GUI release. Hero battery card, four setting tiles, four profiles, paired-devices panel, and a live activity log. KDE Plasma 6 libnotify integration verified end-to-end. Tray icon and BlueZ discovery are scaffolded; full D-Bus bindings land in a follow-up.</p>
